# Retry schedule for webhook delivery (ADR-0009): 4 attempts, wait before attempt i+1 is 3^i s (3, 9, 27).
# Attempts: RELAY_ATTEMPTS (default 4). RELAY_RETRY_MAX is no longer read (CHANGELOG 1.9.0).
